</ul></nav></section><section class="front-matter"><div class="ameta p font-secondary font-xs">
<hgroup><h1>Effects of focal brain damage on political behaviour across different political ideologies</h1></hgroup><div class="cg p">
<a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Siddiqi%20SH"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id1"><span class="name western">Shan H Siddiqi</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id1">
<h3><span class="name western">Shan H Siddiqi</span></h3>
<div class="p">
<sup>1</sup>
Center for Brain Circuit Therapeutics, Center for Brain-Mind Medicine, and Department of Psychiatry, Mass General Brigham/Harvard Medical School, Boston, MA 02115, USA</div>
<div class="p">Find articles by <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Siddiqi%20SH"[Author]' class="usa-link"><span class="name western">Shan H Siddiqi</span></a>
</div>
</div>
<sup>1,</sup><sup>✉</sup>, <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Balters%20S"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id2"><span class="name western">Stephanie Balters</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id2">
<h3><span class="name western">Stephanie Balters</span></h3>
<div class="p">
<sup>2</sup>
Department of Psychiatry and Behavioral Sciences, Stanford University School of Medicine, Palo Alto, CA 94305, USA</div>
<div class="p">Find articles by <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Balters%20S"[Author]' class="usa-link"><span class="name western">Stephanie Balters</span></a>
</div>
</div>
<sup>2</sup>, <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Zamboni%20G"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id3"><span class="name western">Giovanna Zamboni</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id3">
<h3><span class="name western">Giovanna Zamboni</span></h3>
<div class="p">
<sup>3</sup>
Department of Biomedical, Metabolic, and Neural Sciences, University of Modena and Reggio Emilia, Modena, MO 41121, Italy</div>
<div class="p">Find articles by <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Zamboni%20G"[Author]' class="usa-link"><span class="name western">Giovanna Zamboni</span></a>
</div>
</div>
<sup>3</sup>, <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Cohen-Zimerman%20S"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id4"><span class="name western">Shira Cohen-Zimerman</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id4">
<h3><span class="name western">Shira Cohen-Zimerman</span></h3>
<div class="p">
